Title: The Prince and the Rose
Credit: Draft v0 (imported from ChatGPT, provisional)
Draft date: 2026-10-01

FADE IN:

EXT. SPACE - AURELIA - MORNING

A tiny spherical planet floats in a vast blue-black star field. On its upper surface: a miniature 1830s palace, gardens, forests, tiny villages. Warm morning light.

We push toward the palace and descend into--

EXT. ROYAL GARDEN OF AURELIA - CONTINUOUS

ELIAS (10), a slight prince in a navy velvet jacket, walks alone along an ancient stone path.

He drifts away from the manicured beds, pushes aside a curtain of ivy--

A forgotten circular flower bed. One patch of sunlight falls on a single rose.

The garden goes quiet. Elias steps closer.

He kneels. Reaches out. Stops short of touching it.

No wind. Yet the ROSE slowly turns toward him. Her petals glow faintly.

ELIAS
(whispering)
Are you... alive?

ROSE
Of course I am alive, little prince.

Elias freezes. Looks around for someone playing a trick. Nobody.

ELIAS
You... you can talk?

ROSE
I have been waiting a very long time for you.

Elias leans in. The Rose's warmth drains away; her golden glow dims.

Far beyond the garden wall, one patch of sky darkens.

ROSE (CONT'D)
You must listen carefully, Elias. Your little world is not as safe as you believe.

Elias turns toward the curved horizon. A strange SILVER LIGHT rises beyond the edge of Aurelia.

We pull back until boy and rose are tiny against the enormous sky.

FADE TO BLACK.

> THE PRINCE AND THE ROSE <
> The adventure has only begun... <
